program	module_path_shadow.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	mapped package `mpshadow` shadows a local module file `examples/mpshadow.saw`; rename the local module or the dependency
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: mapped package `mpshadow` shadows a local module file `examples/mpshadow.saw`; rename the local module or the dependency"
